WEBVTT

00:10:57.246 --> 00:11:00.496
how could we allow prisons
to exist the way they do?

00:11:01.329 --> 00:11:05.454
Institutional buildings have to be
radically rethought under this rubric of

00:11:05.746 --> 00:11:08.871
the right to clean air, the
right to breathe freely.

00:11:09.371 --> 00:11:11.121
And I think that's a, well,

00:11:11.121 --> 00:11:15.954
challenging and certainly going to
be difficult to redesign spaces.

00:11:15.954 --> 00:11:19.787
I think the public will be demanding
more accountability from

00:11:19.787 --> 00:11:22.287
the world around us, which I think
is a really good thing.

00:11:24.412 --> 00:11:27.079
That's Michael Murphy. He's
the founding principle

00:11:27.079 --> 00:11:31.204
and executive director of Mars Design
Group, which designs hospitals,